    {
      "id": "claim_6ed55526b914485c898ae7f6a5ebfa2b",
      "statement": "FI-US-DURATION-PATH Edition 2026-10, published 2026-10-06 and applicable to positions taken on or after 2026-11-01, recommends a modest +0.4-year duration position versus benchmark in the five-to-ten-year sector and excludes a long-end duration expression.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://research/FI/US/DURATION-PATH/2026-10.md#L5-L18",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:cb1a3c33ac87ebe0a5208e916ee5cca7f45d852b0b866f305029f5d4cb77106e:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_2eab8ac9bef2428eb086714af5b4c3ae",
      "statement": "The duration view is a modest scenario deviation: the desk assumes one further policy-rate increase over 12 months versus 1.5 increases implied by the market, and states that this half-step difference is the whole recommendation rather than a conviction call.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://research/FI/US/DURATION-PATH/2026-10.md#L20-L24",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:b7deef73c079168a09ff18752e7cd9d5aafbe70cfa48095c32021d19f30d1e43:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_f6fcc2a2cc6447a2a8038ba9519be2b4",
      "statement": "In September 2026, the FOMC raised the target range by 25 basis points to 3-3/4 to 4 percent because it judged a somewhat more restrictive stance appropriate, while stating that inflation remained elevated relative to its 2 percent objective.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://bulletins/FED/2026-09-fomc-statement.md#L10-L16",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:424eb8016dac92e84d969206ff391e58901fc80251a0569cc6e58ec5f48beae6:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_0231b8fdf1ed4a918583b65fab258ad8",
      "statement": "The view excludes a long-end duration expression because the desk sees term premium as fair to cheap, heavy long-end supply, and no catalyst for compression within 12 months; such a position would be a term-premium view the desk does not hold.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://research/FI/US/DURATION-PATH/2026-10.md#L26-L28",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:880986461ae0fddda298978af32a55358053469fce396058114d12748df5f5ba:"
