    {
      "id": "claim_c06f4a9521d5499696ba2bf57a6de242",
      "statement": "The stated risks are inflation prints that turn the desk's assumed single increase into a sequence, a fiscal event that increases long-end supply beyond projections, and a disorderly term-premium repricing that would hurt the front-loaded position; the note also cites three July dissents favoring an increase.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://research/FI/US/DURATION-PATH/2026-10.md#L34-L36",
